<Track #improve-modeling-authoring-guidance apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { status = "completed" goal = "修复 E2E dogfood 暴露的两个 modeling XNL 形式偏差：component 四块裸标签（+validate 宽容 role 写法）、shell kind 节点标签形式；并把 modeling validate 接进 track/implement 自检。" description = "真实大模型生成 modeling 概念质量高但栽在 XNL 形式歧义（component 四块写成 types role、shell kind 当标签名）。本 track 澄清规范 + validate 宽容 + 流程自检 + E2E 回归。门控于 config/modeling.xml。" type = "feature" commit_mode = "manual" created_at = "2026-06-21T00:00:00Z" updated_at = "2026-06-21T10:00:00Z" } (
